  "reference": "Abaramuzi 20",
  "verseCount": 48,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli bona bahurura, kwema Dani kugoba Beerisheba, n'ensi ya Gileadi ebulimu. Enteko ehurura oti muntu omoi eija aha Mukama omuli Mizipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuru b'embaga yona omu nganda zona za Isiraeli baija omu nteko y'Omukama, abaisherukale 40,000 ab'embanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Aho Ababenjamini bahulira okwo Abaisiraeli baizire Mizipa). Abaisiraeli bagambira Omulevita bati, “Tugambire ekihemu eki kikaija kitai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulevita, iba omukazi ayaisirwe, ahorora ati, “Nkaija Gibea eya Benjamini, inye n'ensholeke yange kushura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashaija ba Gibea bantabalira, bazinda enju obuzingora kili kiro; bhakaba nibenda kunyita, kandi bahamba ensholeke yange, efa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkwata ensholeke yange egyo ngichwamu ebichweka, ngitweka omu nsi yona y'obusika bwa Isiraeli; aha rw'enshonga bakozire ekihemu mara ihano omuli Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murore, inywe Baisiraeli inywena, mugambe muhanure aha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baimuka oti muntu omoi nibagamba bati, “Ichwe thaliho muntu aragya mw'ihemalye, nangu n'omoi omuli ichwe kugaruka mwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu Gibea nitwija kugigira tuti: Omuli ichwe abaratekerwa enshoga turagibunda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu 100 twihyemu abashaija 10, omu nganda zona za Isiraeli, 1000 omu 1000 na 1000 omu 10,000, baletere abantu entanda, Gibea eya Benjamini bagikore akalimo, bazire ekihemu ekyo bakozire omuli Isiraeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Abaisiraeli bona abashaija bema hamoi oti muntu omoi, bazinda ekigo kya Gibea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enganda za Isiraeli zituma abantu omu ruganda rwona rwa Benjamini nibagamba bati, “Eki kihemu nyabaki ekibaireho omuli inywe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu aha rw'ekyo mutaishure abantu abo, empwabujwa za Gibea tubaite, tuchwe eihano omuli Isiraeli.” Kyonkai Ababenjamini tibahuliire byo barumuna babo Abaisiraeli bagambire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baruga omu bigo, bateranira Gibea kutera Abaisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo Ababenjamini baruga omu bigo byabo, bahurura abaisherukale ab'embanda 26,000 otatairemu bashaija ba Gibea 700 endondwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli aba bona hakaba halimu abashaija 700 abarondwa ab'emosho; buli omoi ayakushoboire kurasha eibare omu kihubeezo akatera orushoke rutamulemire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli, Benjamini etabulimu, bakahurura abaisherukale b'embanda 400,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli baimuka bagya Betheli, babaza Ruhanga bati, “Ni rugandaki omuli ichwe oruragenda mbere kutera Ababenjamini?” Omukama agamba ati, “Aba Yuda bagende mbere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Abaisiraeli baimuka bwankya basisira kutera Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabara kurashanisa Benjamini bemire Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababenjamini baturuka Gibea, kir'ekyo baita Abaisiraeli 22,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Abaisiraeli bakwata mashaija, bashuba batekateka endashana omu mwanya gwonene gwonene mbali babaire bagitekatekeire kiro ekya mbere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagenda bataka omu maisho g'Omukama kuturuka bwaigoro. Babaza Omukama bati, “Tushubeyo kurwanisa barumuna baitu Ababenjamini?” Omukama agamba ati, “Mugende mubarashanise.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo batabalira Ababenjamini ekiro kya kabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'Ababenjamini baturuka Gibea ekiro kya kabili ekyo kubarashanisa. Abaisiraeli 18,000 abaisherukale b'embanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho eihe lyona ly'Abaisiraeli ligya Betheli, lishuntama omu maisho g'Omukama litaka, mara kir'ekyo lisiiba kugoba bwaigoro. Bahonga ebihongo by'okwokibwa n'ebihongo by'emilembe omu maisho g'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaza Omukama (aha rw'enshonga biro bilinya Esanduku ya Ruhanga y'Endagano niho yabaire eli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Finehasi eya Eleazari, Eleazari eya Aroni niwe yalilebeleraga), babaza bati, “Tushube tutabalire barumuna baitu Ababenjamini anga tulekere?” Omukama agamba ati, “Mugende, aha rw'okuba nyenkya nimbabanaga omu mikono.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
